## Scroll Transition Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Scroll
    participant ST as useScrollTransition
    participant Hero as HeroSection
    participant Cloud as CloudOverlay
    participant About as AboutSection

    User->>ST: scroll event
    ST->>ST: Calculate targetProgress
    ST->>ST: RAF tick() → smooth interpolation
    
    Note over ST: scrollProgress: 0 → 1
    
    ST->>Hero: isFrozen (>5%), zoomProgress (0→50%)
    ST->>Cloud: cloudProgress (15%→70%)
    ST->>About: aboutProgress (50%→100%)
```

### Progress Ranges

| Property | Scroll Range | Output | Controls |
|----------|--------------|--------|----------|
| `isFrozen` | > 5% | boolean | Freezes map animations |
| `zoomProgress` | 0% → 50% | 0 → 1 | Camera Z zoom |
| `cloudProgress` | 15% → 70% | 0 → 1 | Cloud opacity/scale |
| `aboutProgress` | 50% → 100% | 0 → 1 | About section translateY |

