## useScrollTransition

```typescript
// Returns
{
  scrollProgress: Ref<number>,  // 0-1, smoothed
  isFrozen: ComputedRef<boolean>,
  zoomProgress: ComputedRef<number>,
  cloudProgress: ComputedRef<number>,
  aboutProgress: ComputedRef<number>,
  isMapZoomed: Ref<boolean>,
  setMapZoomed: (zoomed: boolean) => void,
  reset: () => void,
}
```

**Smoothing Engine:**
- Uses RAF-based interpolation
- Damping factor: 0.08 (8% per frame)
- Stops when diff < 0.0005

