## AboutSection Component

### Props
| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `progress` | number | 0-1 slide position |
| `backgroundImage` | string | URL for bg image |

### Computed Styles
```typescript
// Slide-up transform
translateY = 100 - progress * 100  // 100% → 0%

// Background fade (0.8 → 1.0 range)
fadeProgress = (progress - 0.8) / 0.2
```

### Visual States
| Progress | Effect |
|----------|--------|
| 0% | Below viewport |
| 50% | Starts appearing |
| 80% | Background image fades in |
| 95% | Interactive (pointer-events) |
| 100% | Fully visible |

