## CloudOverlay Component

### Configuration
```typescript
const CLOUD_CONFIGS = [
  { id: 1, sx: -60, sy: 0, s: 2.5 },   // Left
  { id: 2, sx: 60, sy: 0, s: 2.5 },    // Right
  { id: 3, sx: 0, sy: -60, s: 2.5 },   // Top
  { id: 4, sx: 0, sy: 60, s: 2.5 },    // Bottom
  // ... 4 more diagonal clouds
]
```

### CSS Animation (GPU-optimized)
```css
--move-factor: calc(1 - (var(--p) * 0.6));

transform: translate3d(
  calc(-50% + (var(--sx) * 1vw * var(--move-factor))),
  calc(-50% + (var(--sy) * 1vh * var(--move-factor))),
  0
) scale(calc(var(--s) * (1 + var(--p) * 0.3)));

opacity: calc(var(--p) * 1.5);
```

