## useMap Composable

### State Interface
```typescript
interface MapState {
  isZoomed: boolean
  isLoading: boolean
  isFrozen: boolean
  isPaused: boolean
}
```

### API
```typescript
{
  state: Ref<MapState>,
  init: (container: HTMLElement) => void,
  dispose: () => void,
  zoomOut: () => void,
  freeze: () => void,
  unfreeze: () => void,
  setScrollZoom: (progress: number) => void,
  pause: () => void,
  resume: () => void,
}
```

### Three.js Scene Structure
```
Scene
├── AmbientLight
├── DirectionalLight (shadows)
├── fogGroup (25 cloud sprites)
├── gridGroup (background grid)
├── combinedMapGroup
│   ├── uz (Uzbekistan regions)
│   │   ├── ExtrudeGeometry meshes
│   │   └── Markers (interactable)
│   ├── kz (Kazakhstan)
│   ├── tm (Turkmenistan)
│   └── ... (other neighbors)
└── labelsGroup (city labels)
```

### Animation Loop
| Step | Function | Condition |
|------|----------|-----------|
| 1 | `tweenGroup.update()` | Always |
| 2 | [animateGrid()](file:///c:/Users/Xensa/Desktop/tour-nuxt/app/composables/useMap/grid.ts#83-104) | Always |
| 3 | [updateParallax()](file:///c:/Users/Xensa/Desktop/tour-nuxt/app/composables/useMap/camera.ts#134-191) | Always |
| 4 | [animateMarkers()](file:///c:/Users/Xensa/Desktop/tour-nuxt/app/composables/useMap/markers.ts#93-126) | !frozen, !zoomed |
| 5 | [updateMarkerScales()](file:///c:/Users/Xensa/Desktop/tour-nuxt/app/composables/useMap/markers.ts#70-92) | !frozen |
| 6 | [updateLabelPositions()](file:///c:/Users/Xensa/Desktop/tour-nuxt/app/composables/useMap/labels.ts#340-361) | !frozen, labels exist |
| 7 | [updateLabelsProximity()](file:///c:/Users/Xensa/Desktop/tour-nuxt/app/composables/useMap/labels.ts#282-339) | !frozen, !zoomed |
| 8 | Fog animation | !frozen, !zoomed |
| 9 | `renderer.render()` | Always |

