## Performance Optimizations

| Area | Technique |
|------|-----------|
| Scroll | RAF-based smoothing, passive listeners |
| Map | Plain object for zoomBlend (no Vue reactivity) |
| Renderer | Capped pixel ratio (2x max), conditional AA |
| Clouds | CSS calc() transforms, `contain: strict` |
| Labels | Proximity check skipped when zoomed |
| Fog | Indexed for-loop instead of forEach |

